  - id: manner_of_king
    displayName: The Manner of the King
    flavorText: Samuel warns Israel exactly what a king will take from them before
      they get one.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Samuel warns the people exactly what a king will take from them - their
      sons for his chariots, their daughters for his kitchens, a tenth of their flocks
      and fields - before they get the king they demanded anyway. A real cautionary
      word given and then overridden by the people's own insistence.
    deliveredByManagerId: samuel
